INSERT INTO event VALUES('evt_0deec4f1a001b7pJRSN7w7kZrp','ses_f211dfcd4ffevS1Yoddwab036g',550,'message.part.updated.1','{"sessionID":"ses_f211dfcd4ffevS1Yoddwab036g","part":{"id":"prt_0deec40a6001sWNBZ6mcnPlUDB","sessionID":"ses_f211dfcd4ffevS1Yoddwab036g","messageID":"msg_0deec3bd1001GIjU6UPtzhBv9C","type":"reasoning","text":"Findings so far:\n\n1. **There is no \"Hermes\" agent.** `~/.hermes/` contains exactly one file — `skins/blood.yaml`, which the install script wrote. No `hermes` binary on PATH, no process. So \"go back through my sessions on Hermes\" is not something that exists. I can''t review it.\n\n2. **opencode sessions** live in `~/.local/share/opencode/opencode.db` (SQLite, 843KB + 4MB WAL). I *could* read that, but: it''s this session''s own database and contains credentials-adjacent stuff (`auth.json` exists). Reading session history to inform an install is not needed — and I should be careful. Actually, reading my own past sessions isn''t harmful per se, but it''s not useful for validating a theme install, and I shouldn''t go spelunking. I''ll note it''s available but not needed.\n\n3. **REAL BUG FOUND in alacritty.toml:** The font config references `style: \"Bold\"` and `style: \"Italic\"` for Great Vibes. But Great Vibes Regular.ttf is the only Great Vibes file installed — it''s a single regular weight, no bold/italic variants. Let me verify what styles Great Vibes actually has. From fc-list earlier: only `Great Vibes:style=Regular`. So asking alacritty for Bold/Italic will cause fontconfig fallback → inconsistent rendering, and potentially fallback to a different font mid-stream. That''s a genuine defect worth flagging.\n\n4. **`bg: None fg: None`** — the colors section doesn''t have `background`/`foreground` keys. Let me look at what the colors section actually contains. It may use a different structure or be missing primary bg/fg, which would leave alacritty with default colors instead of black/red. That''s a potential real bug. Let me inspect the actual colors block.\n\nLet me dig into the colors and the font styles. These are the real findings.\n\nLet me check.","time":{"start":1790446420134,"end":1790446423834}},"time":1790446423834}');
