INSERT INTO event VALUES('evt_0df024111001K1JxhI4I9fAAYn','ses_f211dfcd4ffevS1Yoddwab036g',1445,'message.part.updated.1','{"sessionID":"ses_f211dfcd4ffevS1Yoddwab036g","part":{"id":"prt_0df023931001Fx8N0QSdc2EFC3","sessionID":"ses_f211dfcd4ffevS1Yoddwab036g","messageID":"msg_0df023198001dahPjtk52qg1Yr","type":"text","text":"One concrete gotcha, specific to your setup: **Baloo is actively indexing**, and its exclude list has no `.txt`. A token saved as `token.txt` on the Desktop gets slurped into `~/.local/share/baloo/index` — a binary database, where it survives deletion of the original file and is reachable from KDE''s search UI.\n\nSave it, but do this instead — filename ends in `.md`, which Baloo''s `*.md`-adjacent filtering and the `.directory`-hidden convention both handle better, or just avoid the index entirely:","time":{"start":1790447860017,"end":1790447862033}},"time":1790447862033}');
