INSERT INTO event VALUES('evt_0df03ef80001kAN19GsaKGBWbU','ses_f211dfcd4ffevS1Yoddwab036g',1486,'message.part.updated.1','{"sessionID":"ses_f211dfcd4ffevS1Yoddwab036g","part":{"id":"prt_0df03df9c001SkS1c7b4k7bNIB","sessionID":"ses_f211dfcd4ffevS1Yoddwab036g","messageID":"msg_0df03d8c70014tHpKvkhn0dXjE","type":"reasoning","text":"Interesting! There are actually THREE files:\n1. `/home/livings/.config/gh/token` — 186 bytes, mode 600, modified 11:38 — this is from the `bash -c ''read...''` command they ran! It has content (186 bytes). That''s the real token.\n2. `/home/livings/.config/gh/token.md` — 0 bytes, mode 600, 11:37 — the empty file I created.\n3. `/home/livings/Desktop/token.txt` — 94 bytes, mode 644, 11:38 — the one they mention.\n\nWait, 186 bytes vs 94 bytes. Different sizes! A GitHub fine-grained token `github_pat_...` is about 93-95 characters. So 94 bytes = the actual token (with trailing newline probably). 186 bytes is roughly 2x — that could be TWO tokens concatenated, or the token plus something else.\n\nHmm. Let me think. Actually, the `bash -c ''read -rs...''` uses `read` which reads ONE LINE. So it saved one line. 186 bytes is suspicious.\n\nWait — maybe the earlier failed fish `read -rs` command... no, that failed.\n\nActually, let me reconsider: maybe the user ran the bash -c command and pasted the token, and the terminal/the read captured more. Or maybe they pasted twice.\n\nLet me NOT print the contents. Let me safely analyze structure: line count, line lengths, and prefixes — without revealing the secret.\n\nThis matters: if `~/.config/gh/token` has 186 bytes it may be malformed (two lines), which would break the API call. I need to diagnose without leaking.\n\nLet me check line count and line lengths only.\n\nLet me be careful and only print structural info.\n\nThen use the correct one. The Desktop one (94 bytes) is likely the clean token. The config/gh/token (186) may have an issue.\n\nLet me inspect structurally.\n\nLet me also fix perms on the Desktop file.\n\nLet me do this carefully.","time":{"start":1790447968156,"end":1790447972224}},"time":1790447972224}');
