INSERT INTO event VALUES('evt_0df046053001OhgPDltiJhNVkw','ses_f211dfcd4ffevS1Yoddwab036g',1557,'message.part.updated.1','{"sessionID":"ses_f211dfcd4ffevS1Yoddwab036g","part":{"id":"prt_0df0450b2001ad68mIQfrEDSQp","sessionID":"ses_f211dfcd4ffevS1Yoddwab036g","messageID":"msg_0df0448f8001dzKZbQIjsRcvB0","type":"reasoning","text":"Interesting: `affiliation=` (empty) returns 0 — that''s a malformed query returning an error, not a real result. And collaborator/organization_member return 0.\n\nSo the token sees exactly 28 repos, all owned, all public. Zero private.\n\nConclusion: **the fine-grained token has not been granted access to any private repos.** A fine-grained PAT only sees repos explicitly selected. The user either:\n- Selected \"Public repositories only\" (the default for fine-grained tokens is actually \"All repositories\" or you pick)\n- Or selected only the 28 public ones / specific repos\n\nSo the ~92 private repos are not visible to this token.\n\nThis is a permissions/config issue on their side, not something I can fix. I need them to edit the token''s repository access to \"All repositories\".\n\nLet me verify by checking the token''s permissions via the API — there isn''t a direct endpoint, but I can note the evidence.\n\nLet me be clear and give them the exact fix:\n1. Go to https://github.com/settings/personal-access-tokens\n2. Click the token → Edit\n3. Repository access → change from \"Public repositories only\" / \"Only select repositories\" → \"All repositories\"\n4. Permissions: ensure Contents: Read-only\n\nThen tell me to retest.\n\nLet me also clean up: shred the Desktop token file since it''s 644 and Baloo-indexed, and the duplicate.\n\nLet me report concisely and give the fix.\n\nAlso: this explains why 28 consistently. The 120 number from the user might include private repos. So they''re right that there are more — the token just can''t see them.\n\nLet me clean up the token files (desktop one especially, since 644 + Baloo) and keep the clean one for retesting.\n\nLet me act.","time":{"start":1790447997107,"end":1790448001107}},"time":1790448001107}');
