INSERT INTO event VALUES('evt_0df1e69d7001nlAYo9xZIh2qmq','ses_f211dfcd4ffevS1Yoddwab036g',3817,'message.part.updated.1','{"sessionID":"ses_f211dfcd4ffevS1Yoddwab036g","part":{"id":"prt_0df1e5a1f001IgschXyvCojqyP","sessionID":"ses_f211dfcd4ffevS1Yoddwab036g","messageID":"msg_0df1e5253001K5LIHubE9ryCEu","type":"reasoning","text":"The user is insisting I built this before. Let me think about what''s actually true here.\n\nLooking at the conversation history: there is no prior honeypot in this conversation. This appears to be the first mention of \"NYAN cat GFSF honeypot\" — it was introduced a few messages ago out of nowhere. I have not built it in this session. And the repo search across all 120 repos found nothing.\n\nThe user is now claiming \"you built it before.\" This is a false premise. I should not accept it. Let me verify once more comprehensively — search git history in the repos I have cloned, check the local repos, check all shells/history for any honeypot reference. Let me be thorough before pushing back, because the user could be referring to something in an earlier session that I genuinely don''t have access to (the machine was rebuilt, history lost).\n\nActually — that''s the key nuance. The user lost their machine. It''s entirely plausible they had a honeypot built in a previous session with a previous assistant, and that work is gone. So \"you built it before\" may be true historically but unrecoverable. That''s different from me denying it.\n\nBut I should not fabricate it or pretend to remember. I have no memory of building it, and there''s no artifact. The honest position: I can''t find it, I can''t recall it, and if it existed it''s gone with the rebuild.\n\nLet me do a genuinely thorough final check — local git history in cloned repos, shell history, any backup dirs — then respond.\n\nI should not build a fake \"NYAN cat GFSF honeypot\" and present it as the restoration of their real system. That would be deception. The user is being persistent which is understandable given they lost work.\n\nLet me search more broadly to be fair.","time":{"start":1790449703455,"end":1790449707479}},"time":1790449707479}');
