o authenticate but locked out\n    HIT  sudo:  attacker : 3 incorrect password attempts ; TTY=pts/0 ; USER=root ; CO\n    HIT  login: FAILED LOGIN 1 FROM 198.51.100.9\n    HIT  sudo:  evil : a password is required ; TTY=pts/1 ; USER=root ; COMMAND=/usr/\n    HIT  kernel: usb 1-3: new high-speed USB device number 5 using xhci_hcd\n    HIT  pam_unix(sudo:auth): authentication failure; logname=eve uid=1001 euid=0 tty\n  -- benign (want ignore) --\n    ok    sudo:  livings : a password is required ; TTY=pts/0 ; PWD=/home/livings ; US\n    ok    konsole[18439]: PreviewJob subjob had an error: The file or folder /etc/secu\n    ok    sudo:  livings : TTY=pts/2 ; PWD=/home/livings ; USER=root ; COMMAND=/usr/bi\n    ok    systemd[1]: Started Getty on tty2.\n    ok    kernel: EXT4-fs (nvme0n1p2): mounted filesystem\n\n  misses: 0   false positives: 0\n  RESULT: PASS\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"time":{"start":1790449836543,"end":1790449836625}}},"time":1790449836625}');
