INSERT INTO event VALUES('evt_0df25ed0a0012ubks6IvQ5sdfH','ses_f20e5cfc2ffeSFa4odnoYLiUOk',494,'message.part.updated.1','{"sessionID":"ses_f20e5cfc2ffeSFa4odnoYLiUOk","part":{"id":"prt_0df25ecfc001EbqkhH977XNfYP","sessionID":"ses_f20e5cfc2ffeSFa4odnoYLiUOk","messageID":"msg_0df25d878001msl5UHWVyXPifV","type":"tool","callID":"call_function_l6k1ga5m8brf_2","tool":"read","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/home/livings/Projects/hermes-blood/README.md"},"output":"<path>/home/livings/Projects/hermes-blood/README.md</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: # Blood Build — Black & Red System Theme\n2: \n3: Complete black-background, blood-red system theme for KDE Plasma, Alacritty, Konsole, OpenCode, Hermes Agent, Fish shell, and GTK apps.\n4: \n5: ## Colors\n6: \n7: - Background: `#050507` (blood black)\n8: - Foreground: `#C8102E` (blood red)\n9: - Bright: `#FF1744`\n10: - Dim: `#8B0000`\n11: \n12: ## Font\n13: \n14: - **All system fonts**: Great Vibes (cursive)\n15: - Installed to: `~/.local/share/fonts/GreatVibes-Regular.ttf`\n16: \n17: ## What''s included\n18: \n19: | Component | File | Installs to |\n20: |-----------|------|-------------|\n21: | Alacritty | `alacritty/alacritty.toml` | `~/.config/alacritty/alacritty.toml` |\n22: | Konsole colorscheme | `konsole/BlackRed.colorscheme` | `~/.local/share/konsole/BlackRed.colorscheme` |\n23: | Konsole profile | `konsole/Garuda.profile` | `~/.local/share/konsole/Garuda.profile` |\n24: | Konsole config | `konsole/konsolerc` | `~/.config/konsolerc` |\n25: | OpenCode theme | `opencode/voidlit.json` | `~/.config/opencode/themes/voidlit.json` |\n26: | Hermes skin | `themes/blood.yaml` | `~/.hermes/skins/blood.yaml` |\n27: | GTK settings | `gtk/settings.ini` | `~/.config/gtk-3.0/` + `gtk-4.0/settings.ini` |\n28: | GTK2 config | `gtk/.gtkrc-2.0` | `~/.gtkrc-2.0` |\n29: | KDE globals | `gtk/kdeglobals` | `~/.config/kdeglobals` |\n30: | Fonts | `fonts/GreatVibes-Regular.ttf` | `~/.local/share/fonts/` |\n31: \n32: ## Install\n33: \n34: ```bash\n35: git clone https://github.com/intricos777-dot/hermes-blood.git ~/.hermes/hermes-blood\n36: cd ~/.hermes/hermes-blood\n37: ./scripts/install.sh\n38: ```\n39: \n40: Log out and back in to see all changes.\n41: \n42: ## Structure\n43: \n44: ```\n45: alacritty/alacritty.toml\n46: fonts/DancingScript-VariableFont_wght.ttf\n47: fonts/GreatVibes-Regular.ttf\n48: gtk/.gtkrc-2.0\n49: gtk/kdeglobals\n50: gtk/settings.ini\n51: konsole/BlackRed.colorscheme\n52: konsole/Garuda.profile\n53: konsole/konsolerc\n54: opencode/voidlit.json\n55: themes/blood.yaml\n56: scripts/install.sh\n57: README.md\n58: ```\n59: \n60: ## Notes\n61: \n62: - Blood icon theme inherits from BeautyLine + hicolor (safe fallback)\n63: - Great Vibes is variable-width — alignment in terminals/code editors may differ\n64: - Fish shell colors are set via `fish_variables` (not included — set separately)\n\n(End of file - total 64 lines)\n</content>","title":"home/livings/Projects/hermes-blood/README.md","metadata":{"preview":"# Blood Build — Black & Red System Theme\n\nComplete black-background, blood-red system theme for KDE Plasma, Alacritty, Konsole, OpenCode, Hermes Agent, Fish shell, and GTK apps.\n\n## Colors\n\n- Background: `#050507` (blood black)\n- Foreground: `#C8102E` (blood red)\n- Bright: `#FF1744`\n- Dim: `#8B0000`\n\n## Font\n\n- **All system fonts**: Great Vibes (cursive)\n- Installed to: `~/.local/share/fonts/GreatVibes-Regular.ttf`\n\n## What''s included\n\n| Component | File | Installs to |\n|-----------|------|-------------|","truncated":false,"loaded":[],"display":{"type":"file","path":"/home/livings/Projects/hermes-blood/README.md","text":"# Blood Build — Black & Red System Theme\n\nComplete black-background, blood-red system theme for KDE Plasma, Alacritty, Konsole, OpenCode, Hermes Agent, Fish shell, and GTK apps.\n\n## Colors\n\n- Background: `#050507` (blood black)\n- Foreground: `#C8102E` (blood red)\n- Bright: `#FF1744`\n- Dim: `#8B0000`\n\n## Font\n\n- **All system fonts**: Great Vibes (cursive)\n- Installed to: `~/.local/share/fonts/GreatVibes-Regular.ttf`\n\n## What''s included\n\n| Component | File | Installs to |\n|-----------|------|-------------|\n| Alacritty | `alacritty/alacritty.toml` | `~/.config/alacritty/alacritty.toml` |\n| Konsole colorscheme | `konsole/BlackRed.colorscheme` | `~/.local/share/konsole/BlackRed.colorscheme` |\n| Konsole profile | `konsole/Garuda.profile` | `~/.local/share/konsole/Garuda.profile` |\n| Konsole config | `konsole/konsolerc` | `~/.config/konsolerc` |\n| OpenCode theme | `opencode/voidlit.json` | `~/.config/opencode/themes/voidlit.json` |\n| Hermes skin | `themes/blood.yaml` | `~/.hermes/skins/blood.yaml` |\n| GTK settings | `gtk/settings.ini` | `~/.config/gtk-3.0/` + `gtk-4.0/settings.ini` |\n| GTK2 config | `gtk/.gtkrc-2.0` | `~/.gtkrc-2.0` |\n| KDE globals | `gtk/kdeglobals` | `~/.config/kdeglobals` |\n| Fonts | `fonts/GreatVibes-Regular.ttf` | `~/.local/share/fonts/` |\n\n## Install\n\n```bash\ngit clone https://github.com/intricos777-dot/hermes-blood.git ~/.hermes/hermes-blood\ncd ~/.hermes/hermes-blood\n./scripts/install.sh\n```\n\nLog out and back in to see all changes.\n\n## Structure\n\n```\nalacritty/alacritty.toml\nfonts/DancingScript-VariableFont_wght.ttf\nfonts/GreatVibes-Regular.ttf\ngtk/.gtkrc-2.0\ngtk/kdeglobals\ngtk/settings.ini\nkonsole/BlackRed.colorscheme\nkonsole/Garuda.profile\nkonsole/konsolerc\nopencode/voidlit.json\nthemes/blood.yaml\nscripts/install.sh\nREADME.md\n```\n\n## Notes\n\n- Blood icon theme inherits from BeautyLine + hicolor (safe fallback)\n- Great Vibes is variable-width — alignment in terminals/code editors may differ\n- Fish shell colors are set via `fish_variables` (not included — set separately)","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":64,"totalLines":64,"truncated":false}},"time":{"start":1790450199808,"end":1790450199818}}},"time":1790450199818}');
