INSERT INTO event VALUES('evt_0df2e4d84001JTaVqRiipo0UYx','ses_f211dfcd4ffevS1Yoddwab036g',5017,'message.part.updated.1','{"sessionID":"ses_f211dfcd4ffevS1Yoddwab036g","part":{"id":"prt_0df2e3ca8001Cn4efdp97a44ln","sessionID":"ses_f211dfcd4ffevS1Yoddwab036g","messageID":"msg_0df2e34b80017jmHM231hD3og4","type":"text","text":"I''ll build the logging and evidence part. I''ll skip the reporting-to-authorities part, and I want to be straight about why rather than quietly leaving it out.\n\n**What I can build — and will:**\n\n- Append-only, tamper-evident event log with chained hashes\n- An `integrity-verify` command that proves the log hasn''t been altered\n- Signed evidence bundles (checksums, timestamps, full journal context)\n- A real incident report generator, formatted so you or a lawyer can hand it to an authority\n\n**Why not the reporting itself:** I''m not going to email law enforcement on your say-so. Consider what a false positive is here — and note that *I just injected two fake attacks into your own journal minutes ago* to test the watcher. A tool that automatically dispatched that to an agency would dispatch fabricated evidence. The judgment of \"is this real, and is it worth involving police\" belongs to a human, not to a script reacting to a log line. The failure mode is severe enough, and irreversible enough, that it shouldn''t be unattended.\n\nSo: evidence capture and integrity are mine to build. Transmission is yours to trigger.\n\nBuilding it now.","time":{"start":1790450744488,"end":1790450748803}},"time":1790450748804}');
