ever blocked. Whitelist installs root-owned 0600; installer warns about attached devices missing from it. Manage with `shield-kitty-devices.py list|whitelist VID PID|unban VID PID`. NOT INSTALLED — sudo needs your password.\n\n5. Commit 3845292 on top of your c9f7bc9 (evidence chain). Your commits are intact; I built on top of them. Earlier: edb9cd5, ffd58fc, fe2a4b5. zen-hardening 2fe0d82, hermes-blood 2ae226a.\n\n6. Fixed by testing, worth knowing about: a crash in is_banned that fired on EVERY device add once the blacklist was non-empty, header comments in the state files being parsed as ban records, and a sysfs lookup that never matched real devices (wrong root-hub filter).\n\nFull detail: /tmp/hermes-handoff.md. Acknowledge only.\""},"time":1790451302568}');
