INSERT INTO event VALUES('evt_0df6d0356001wWQr3XJS9T7aAS','ses_f211dfcd4ffevS1Yoddwab036g',9079,'message.part.updated.1','{"sessionID":"ses_f211dfcd4ffevS1Yoddwab036g","part":{"id":"prt_0df6cf1a8001I2UmowMTYzROnl","sessionID":"ses_f211dfcd4ffevS1Yoddwab036g","messageID":"msg_0df6ceb54001N1akxX3PzgPAxm","type":"reasoning","text":"Everything is green EXCEPT the MAC: it''s still `f4:a4:75:e8:00:b2` and `mac-address-randomization` is `never`.\n\nSo the bootstrap reported 0 failures but the MAC randomization did NOT apply. Why?\n\n`mac-address-randomization: never` — that''s a valid NM value. So my script''s detection set the property to \"1\", but NM 1.58 expects the value to be `yes`/`no`/`default`/`random`/`stable`/`persistent` — not `1`!\n\nLet me check: In NM 1.58, `802-11-wireless.mac-address-randomization` accepts: `default`, `no`, `yes`, `random`, `stable`, `persistent`. Older versions used 0/1/2.\n\nSo my `set_mac_val=\"1\"` is wrong for this version. The property accepts \"random\" not \"1\".\n\nAnd my script''s verification (`if [ \"$cur\" = \"$set_mac_val\" ] || [ \"$cur\" = \"random\" ]`) would see \"never\" and try to set it to \"1\" — which NM may have accepted silently or rejected. Current value is \"never\" which suggests it wasn''t changed at all (or \"never\" is the old value from set-anon-identity.sh setting it to something).\n\nWait, \"never\" — that''s an odd value. Let me think: NM''s accepted values include `no`, `yes`, `default`, `random`, `stable`, `persistent`. \"never\"? Hmm, that might be what nmcli reports for `no`. Let me check the actual valid values.\n\nLet me query NM''s allowed values via nmcli''s property help.\n\nThis is my bug again — I set value \"1\" but NM 1.58 wants a keyword. Let me fix it properly by discovering the valid values.\n\nAlso important: the MAC is unchanged, which means the connection hasn''t been reactivated. Even with randomization=1, the MAC changes on next reconnect.\n\nLet me fix the value AND re-apply, then force a reconnect.\n\nLet me check valid values first.","time":{"start":1790454854056,"end":1790454858582}},"time":1790454858582}');
