INSERT INTO event VALUES('evt_0df753005001J9o985MXGP6ZxA','ses_f211dfcd4ffevS1Yoddwab036g',9326,'message.part.updated.1','{"sessionID":"ses_f211dfcd4ffevS1Yoddwab036g","part":{"id":"prt_0df7520920011inNLxu5FIJKi7","sessionID":"ses_f211dfcd4ffevS1Yoddwab036g","messageID":"msg_0df751a7b001RYlhorcBR0vWBc","type":"reasoning","text":"The user says \"it was not changed may need a full systems reboot so lets continue\".\n\nImportant correction: A full reboot is NOT needed, and won''t help the way they think. The reason the MAC didn''t change is that the user never actually ran the command with sudo — I established that `sudo -n` failed with \"a password is required\", and I told them to run it. They may not have run it.\n\nActually, let me re-read: \"it was not changed may need a full systems reboot\". So they checked and MAC is still `f4:a4:75:e8:00:b2`. They''re attributing it to needing a reboot.\n\nBut actually — the value is still `never` because `set-anon-identity.sh` was never successfully run (no sudo password available to me). I showed \"randomization now: never\" after the failed sudo attempt.\n\nTwo possibilities:\n1. They never ran the command (no sudo).\n2. They ran it, it set `always`, but MAC only changes on reconnect/reboot.\n\nEither way, a reboot IS actually a valid way to force the new MAC to be applied. So the diagnosis \"may need a reboot\" is plausible IF they ran the script.\n\nBut I should verify: check whether the property is now `always` and whether the script was run. That''s the key diagnostic — it distinguishes \"config not set\" from \"config set but not activated\".\n\nLet me check the current property value. If it''s `never`, they didn''t run the script (or it failed). If it''s `always`, then a reconnect/reboot is genuinely what''s needed.\n\nLet me not argue — just check and then either apply or confirm reboot needed.\n\nAlso: rebooting will change the MAC — good. But I should warn: after reboot, verify. Also the network will reconnect.\n\nLet me check state first.\n\nAlso I should push nothing new; just continue.\n\nLet me run the diagnostic.","time":{"start":1790455390354,"end":1790455394309}},"time":1790455394309}');
