w gone.\n\nThe installer probe and the three units both still verify.\"\ngit log --oneline | head -1"},"metadata":{"output":"706c458 fix: arp.dat is written every 15 min, so the 2-min scan was reading stale data\n"},"time":{"start":1790458465566}}},"time":1790458465586}');
