destroyed it if we need another i can make one but we need to delete that token so open my firedragon browser to that page\", \"Anything you want done before you reboot?\"=\"Remove the audit NOPASSWD surface first, Fix the pipestatus pattern in my workflow\". You can now continue with the user''s answers in mind.","title":"Asked 2 questions","metadata":{"answers":[["i destroyed it if we need another i can make one but we need to delete that token so open my firedragon browser to that page"],["Remove the audit NOPASSWD surface first","Fix the pipestatus pattern in my workflow"]],"truncated":false},"time":{"start":1790459578064,"end":1790459675652}}},"time":1790459675652}');
