INSERT INTO event VALUES('evt_0dfb7517f001QD6ekICGXqAtHo','ses_f211dfcd4ffevS1Yoddwab036g',11724,'message.part.updated.1','{"sessionID":"ses_f211dfcd4ffevS1Yoddwab036g","part":{"id":"prt_0dfb74333001vahtn4LfJIz2yf","sessionID":"ses_f211dfcd4ffevS1Yoddwab036g","messageID":"msg_0dfb73b28001WU0sVfmFd8bGfz","type":"reasoning","text":"Confirmed safe. The `ls -l /etc/sudoers.d/audit-readonly` returned nothing visible — because it''s mode 0440 and... actually `ls -l` should still show it. Hmm, it printed nothing for that line. Let me check if it exists.\n\nWait, the output only shows the /usr/local/sbin ones. The `/etc/sudoers.d/audit-readonly` line is missing, meaning `ls -l` failed (file doesn''t exist?) or output was suppressed by 2>/dev/null.\n\nLet me check if the sudoers file exists. If it doesn''t, then the NOPASSWD surface is already gone? But the user''s `sudo -l` earlier showed the NOPASSWD line. Let me verify.\n\nActually /etc/sudoers.d is likely mode 0750 root:root, so as livings I can''t stat inside it — `ls` would get permission denied, suppressed by 2>/dev/null.\n\nLet me check with sudo... but sudo needs a password. Hmm. I can use one of the NOPASSWD wrappers? No, they''re read-only audit wrappers.\n\nActually the user''s earlier `sudo -l` output showed:\n```\n(root) NOPASSWD: /usr/local/sbin/audit-nft, ...\n```\nSo the rule exists. The `ls` failure is just directory permissions.\n\nSo: the removal command is needed, and the user must run it with their password.\n\nLet me give them the command and confirm it''s the right one.\n\nNow for the pipestatus pattern fix. Let me add a verified helper to the repo and document the lesson.\n\nLet me create a small script and add to README.\n\nLet me be proportionate — a compact helper.\n\nLet me write it.\n\nActually, simpler and more valuable: add the lesson to the README''s existing \"verified means\" list (it already lists 7 instances), and create `scripts/git-verified.sh`.\n\nLet me do it.\n\nLet me write the helper.","time":{"start":1790459724595,"end":1790459728254}},"time":1790459728255}');
