INSERT INTO event VALUES('evt_0dfb7f711001rjXI1scumIozCY','ses_f20e5cfc2ffeSFa4odnoYLiUOk',6147,'message.part.updated.1','{"sessionID":"ses_f20e5cfc2ffeSFa4odnoYLiUOk","part":{"id":"prt_0dfb7e734001ya2nP6xr4SWQc4","sessionID":"ses_f20e5cfc2ffeSFa4odnoYLiUOk","messageID":"msg_0dfb7e0760013u6otZRfbSjjue","type":"text","text":"One of the three is done. Deploy the faillock exemption:\n\n```\nsudo ~/Projects/zen-hardening/deploy-faillock-admin.sh --check\n```\n\n```\nsudo ~/Projects/zen-hardening/deploy-faillock-admin.sh\n```\n\nRun `--check` first — it reports what it *would* change without touching anything. The live config has no `admin_group`, so this adds you to `shield-admin` and sets `admin_group = shield-admin`, which makes `livings` permanently exempt while everyone else stays lockable. `unlock_time` stays 30, no permanent `0`.\n\nThe `ignoreip` one I''m going to push back on rather than \"fix\", because the evidence says the current setting may be the safe one:\n\n- Your interface is `10.197.250.246/8 brd 10.255.255.255` with on-link `10.0.0.0/8` — the `/8` is real at the IP layer, not a lazy netmask.\n- Your only neighbour is `10.128.128.128`, in a *different* `/24` from you. So the actual L2 broadcast domain is not derivable from the config; it''s a flat routed `/8`.\n\nIf I narrowed `ignoreip` to a guessed `10.197.250.0/24`, fail2ban would start 24-hour-banning colleagues across an enterprise `/8` the moment one of them mistypes a sudo password five times. That''s the \"fix\" — I''d be trading a silent gap for a self-inflicted outage.\n\nSo: what it does today is ban everything from *outside* `10/8` for 24 hours, and exempt in-network peers. On a shared corporate `/8` that''s the defensible default.\n\nIf you want same-network offenders banned anyway, I need one fact I can''t get from this machine: **the DHCP scope / broadcast domain from your IT team.** Give me that and I''ll narrow it precisely. Failing that, the safe improvement is a shorter `bantime` for in-network hits, which needs a separate jail — say the word and I''ll build it.","time":{"start":1790459766580,"end":1790459770641}},"time":1790459770641}');
