INSERT INTO part VALUES('prt_0deec5765001BpNLOMGnBlOKuG','msg_0deec532b001pXOVeS7AgAjpYh','ses_f211dfcd4ffevS1Yoddwab036g',1790446425957,1790446428237,'{"type":"reasoning","text":"My fc-list query was malformed (the `family=\"Great Vibes\"` filter didn''t apply, so it dumped every font on the system). Let me redo it correctly.\n\nLet me query properly.\n\nEarlier correct output was: `/home/livings/.local/share/fonts/GreatVibes-Regular.ttf: Great Vibes:style=Regular` — only Regular. Let me confirm with a proper query.\n\nLet me check Great Vibes styles specifically.\n\nAlso the colors are fine — `primary.background`/`primary.foreground` are set correctly under `primary`, which is valid alacritty schema (alacritty uses `colors.primary.background`). So my earlier \"bg: None\" was just me looking for the wrong key path. Colors are correct. Good — no bug there.\n\nSo remaining potential issue: font bold/italic styles for Great Vibes.\n\nLet me verify precisely.\n\nAlso I should check the real lockout concerns:\n- konsolerc profile validity\n- whether Konsole is even installed\n- Great Vibes as global KDE font at size 14 — readability. Great Vibes is a formal script/calligraphy font with very poor legibility for UI. This is a genuine usability concern.\n- Also Great Vibes has no bold/italic → KDE will synthesize (faux bold) or fall back.\n\nLet me check these.","time":{"start":1790446425957,"end":1790446428235}}');
