"\n    status_bar_text: \"#C8102E\"\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"echo \"=== gtk-3.0/settings.ini ===\"; cat ~/.config/gtk-3.0/settings.ini 2>&1 | sed ''s/^/  /''\necho; echo \"=== .gtkrc-2.0 ===\"; cat ~/.gtkrc-2.0 2>&1 | sed ''s/^/  /''\necho; echo \"=== blood.yaml ===\"; cat ~/.hermes/skins/blood.yaml 2>&1 | head -30 | sed ''s/^/  /''","time":{"start":1790446435106,"end":1790446435120}}}');
