INSERT INTO part VALUES('prt_0deffdd1f001MVVTpL8VMhcRUi','msg_0deffd537001rebLROoITGdL2E','ses_f211dfcd4ffevS1Yoddwab036g',1790447705375,1790447705376,'{"type":"step-start"}');
INSERT INTO part VALUES('prt_0deffdd21001DDWbmOPzLV7VGJ','msg_0deffd537001rebLROoITGdL2E','ses_f211dfcd4ffevS1Yoddwab036g',1790447705377,1790447710361,'{"type":"text","text":"`github-cli` 2.101.0 is in `extra`. Two commands from you, then I can see all 120:\n\n```bash\nsudo pacman -S github-cli\ngh auth login          # pick \"GitHub.com\" -> \"Login with a web browser\"\n```\n\n`gh auth login` uses a device flow: it prints a one-time code, you paste it into github.com/login/device in your browser. **No token is ever pasted into this chat or into a shell** — which is exactly the property that made the SSH route better than the token you leaked earlier.\n\nThen I''ll run `gh repo list --limit 200 --json name,visibility,language,updatedAt,isArchived` and you''ll get the real inventory: all 120, correctly split public/private, which is what the audit in my last message actually needed to be trustworthy.\n\nTwo things worth saying plainly before you run it:\n\n**That device-flow code is a credential.** It''s short-lived and single-use, but treat it like the token — don''t paste it here. Only enter it on github.com.\n\n**This is the second broad-access grant.** The SSH key already gives full read/write on all 120. `gh` adds API-level visibility (and, depending on scopes, more). Worth deciding deliberately rather than reflexively — if you want read-only auditing, say so and I''ll keep `gh` scoped to `repo` read without write, and you can drop the token afterward with `gh auth logout` while the SSH key keeps git working.\n\nAlso still outstanding: **supercode** has no package or repo I can find, and **hermes** is built but not installed — it needs your `sudo pacman -U`.\n\nSo, three things in flight. Want me to proceed with the audit the moment `gh` is authenticated, or would you rather land hermes first?","time":{"start":1790447705377,"end":1790447710360}}');
