INSERT INTO part VALUES('prt_0df1d2dd3001NdVFHyX6aEoKoX','msg_0df1d2981001pRmVYfD9blkm4I','ses_f20e5cfc2ffeSFa4odnoYLiUOk',1790449626579,1790449630162,'{"type":"reasoning","text":"No gitconfig, no SRCDEST set (so sources go in the build dir itself, which is `/home/livings/.cache/paru/clone/electron34`).\n\nNow let me seed the shallow mirror. I''ll create it carefully.\n\nLet me write the commands:\n```\nDEST=/home/livings/.cache/paru/clone/electron34/chromium-mirror\nrm -rf \"$DEST\"\ngit init --bare --quiet \"$DEST\"\ngit -C \"$DEST\" remote add origin https://github.com/chromium/chromium.git\ngit -C \"$DEST\" config remote.origin.fetch ''+refs/tags/132.0.6834.210:refs/tags/132.0.6834.210''\ngit -C \"$DEST\" config remote.origin.tagOpt --no-tags\ngit -C \"$DEST\" -c safe.bareRepository=all fetch --depth 1 --no-tags origin tag 132.0.6834.210\n```\n\nHmm, `git fetch origin tag <name>` in newer git requires the ref to exist; it should work. Or use:\n`git fetch --depth 1 origin refs/tags/132.0.6834.210:refs/tags/132.0.6834.210`\n\nThat''s more explicit and works. Let''s use that.\n\nAlso need `remote.origin.mirror`? makepkg doesn''t care. But to be safe and semantically a \"mirror\", I could set `remote.origin.mirror=true`. Not needed.\n\nLet me also consider: should I make the fetch refspec the tag only? If later someone bumps pkgver, the refspec would be wrong. But that''s fine for this task; I''ll note it.\n\nActually, a more future-proof refspec that still avoids the 200k branch tips:\n`+refs/tags/132.0.6834.*:refs/tags/132.0.6834.*` — this matches all 132.0.6834.x tags. Chromium has ~100 builds per milestone, each tag''s commit is distinct but they''d be shallow-fetched. Hmm, that''d fetch ~100 commits'' worth of trees/blobs = way too much (each tag = full tree, 1.5 GB → 150 GB). NO. Bad.\n\nKeep it to the single tag. Important: shallow fetch of one tag gives 1 tree.\n\nLet me execute.\n\nNote on `git fetch --depth 1` with explicit refspec: git will fetch that commit with full tree/blobs.","time":{"start":1790449626579,"end":1790449630161}}');
INSERT INTO part VALUES('prt_0df1d2f6b0013sWxbg0oWMthAH','msg_0df1d2a410013y0zpm0vYZ2PD5','ses_f211dfcd4ffevS1Yoddwab036g',1790449626987,1790449626987,'{"type":"step-start"}');
