dy exited — it may have shown and closed)\"\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"cd ~/Projects/nyan-gfsf-alert\necho \"=== inject a synthetic attack into the journal and see if the watcher reacts ===\"\nlogger -p authpriv.warning \"sshd[99999]: Failed password for invalid user root from 198.51.100.42 port 22 ssh2\"\nlogger -p authpriv.warning \"pam_faillock: User livings (uid=1000) tries to authenticate but locked out\"\necho \"  [+] two attack lines logged\"\nsleep 8\necho\necho \"=== did the watcher log an ALERT? ===\"\njournalctl --user -u shield-kitty-watch.service -S \"-30s\" --no-pager 2>&1 | grep -iE \"alert|detected|event\" | sed ''s/^/  /'' || echo \"  no alert logged\"\necho\necho \"=== did the GUI alert process actually launch? ===\"\npgrep -af \"shield-kitty-alert\" | sed ''s/^/  /'' || echo \"  (alert already exited — it may have shown and closed)\"","time":{"start":1790450620482,"end":1790450628527}}}');
