INSERT INTO part VALUES('prt_0df2ec6b1001AsEIui8aWHIBbJ','msg_0df2eabcb001tELmQjd53vSQwu','ses_f20e5cfc2ffeSFa4odnoYLiUOk',1790450779825,1790450782825,'{"type":"text","text":"Found it. Two distinct things:\n\n**The real false positive — `usb_attach` (8 hits, all benign):**\n```\nusb usb1: Product: xHCI Host Controller\nusb usb2: Product: xHCI Host Controller\n```\nThe regex `usb .*(?:new high-speed USB device|Product:)` matches the kernel enumerating the machine''s **own built-in USB controllers at every boot**. It will also fire on any mouse dongle, phone, or drive you plug in.\n\n**The two `critical` hits are test artifacts, not attacks:**\n```\nlivings[186777]: sshd[99999]: Failed password for invalid user root from 198.51.100.42\n```\nPID `99999` is synthetic and `198.51.100.42` is TEST-NET-2 (RFC 5737 documentation range) — those are the selftest probe strings a previous session injected into the journal.\n\nLet me confirm warnings also take over the screen:","time":{"start":1790450779825,"end":1790450782824}}');
