ecord\n  CHAIN INTACT — no evidence of tampering\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"cd ~/Projects/shield-kitty-forensics\ncp /tmp/opencode/evidence-backup/chain.jsonl ~/.local/share/shield-kitty/evidence/chain.jsonl\necho \"=== TAMPER TEST 2: delete record 2 entirely (hide an event) ===\"\npython3 - <<''PY''\nimport json,os\np=os.path.expanduser(\"~/.local/share/shield-kitty/evidence/chain.jsonl\")\nlines=[json.loads(l) for l in open(p) if l.strip()]\ndel lines[1]\nopen(p,\"w\").write(\"\\n\".join(json.dumps(r,sort_keys=True) for r in lines)+\"\\n\")\nprint(\"  [tampered] record 2 deleted\")\nPY\n./evidence.py verify 2>&1 | sed ''s/^/  /''\necho\ncp /tmp/opencode/evidence-backup/chain.jsonl ~/.local/share/shield-kitty/evidence/chain.jsonl\necho \"=== TAMPER TEST 3: truncate the chain (remove old evidence) ===\"\nhead -1 /tmp/opencode/evidence-backup/chain.jsonl > ~/.local/share/shield-kitty/evidence/chain.jsonl\necho \"  [tampered] chain truncated to 1 record\"\n./evidence.py verify 2>&1 | sed ''s/^/  /''","time":{"start":1790450782556,"end":1790450782713}}}');
