+00:00] AUTHENTICATION FAILURE (x42)\n          Failed password for invalid user root from 198.51.100.42\n      [2026-09-26T19:26:16.064234+00:00] USB DEVICE ATTACHED (x1)\n          usb 1-3: new high-speed USB device\n      [2026-09-26T19:26:16.116680+00:00] ACCOUNT LOCKOUT TRIGGERED (x1)\n          pam_faillock: user livings locked out\n  \n    NOTE: this report is evidence of LOGGED ATTEMPTS. It is not proof\n    of a successful compromise. A failed login means the defence held.\n  ========================================================================\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"cd ~/Projects/shield-kitty-forensics\necho \"=== report (last 24h) ===\"\n./evidence.py report --since 24 2>&1 | sed ''s/^/  /''","time":{"start":1790450789568,"end":1790450789636}}}');
