         loaded active running Shield Kitty intrusion watcher (journal tailer)\n\n═══ 2. TIMERS ═══\n  NEXT                         LEFT LAST                              PASSED UNIT                  ACTIVATES\n  Sat 2026-09-26 13:28:04 MST 58min Sat 2026-09-26 12:28:04 MST 1min 30s ago evidence-seal.timer   evidence-seal.service\n  Sun 2026-09-27 07:00:00 MST   18h -                                      - business-health.timer business-health.service\n\n═══ 3. DISK / MEMORY ═══\n  /dev/mapper/luks-8c39203b-6764-4e5c-b1a9-6dedb64c05c1  477G   13G  461G   3% /\n  /dev/nvme0n1p1                                         300M  1.2M  299M   1% /boot/efi\n                 total        used        free      shared  buff/cache   available\n  Mem:           7.4Gi       5.2Gi       595Mi        60Mi       1.9Gi       2.1Gi\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"echo \"═══ 1. SERVICES ═══\"\nsystemctl --failed --no-pager --no-legend 2>/dev/null | sed ''s/^/  failed: /'' || true\n[ -z \"$(systemctl --failed --no-legend 2>/dev/null)\" ] && echo \"  [✓] no failed system units\"\nsystemctl --user list-units --type=service --state=running --no-pager 2>&1 | grep -E \"shield-kitty|business-health\" | sed ''s/^/  /''\necho\necho \"═══ 2. TIMERS ═══\"\nsystemctl --user list-timers --all --no-pager 2>&1 | grep -E \"NEXT|evidence|business\" | sed ''s/^/  /''\necho\necho \"═══ 3. DISK / MEMORY ═══\"\ndf -h / /boot/efi 2>/dev/null | tail -2 | sed ''s/^/  /''\nfree -h | head -2 | sed ''s/^/  /''","time":{"start":1790450974667,"end":1790450974707}}}');
