ve? ===\n  /home/livings/.config/fish/config.fish already has it\n  /home/livings/.bashrc            needs it\nneeds it\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"echo \"=== confirm business-debug works with a real flag ===\"\ntimeout 60 ~/.local/bin/business-debug --security 2>&1 | head -12 | sed ''s/^/  /''\necho\necho \"=== fix PATH: where do shell configs live? ===\"\nfor f in ~/.config/fish/config.fish ~/.bashrc ~/.profile; do\n  [ -f \"$f\" ] && printf \"  %-32s \" \"$f\" && grep -q \"local/bin\" \"$f\" 2>/dev/null && echo \"already has it\" || echo \"needs it\"\ndone","time":{"start":1790451020454,"end":1790451021699}}}');
