6 12:28:24 2026 -0700\nAdd tamper-evident evidence chain, seal timer, and fix service paths\n\n shield-kitty-alert.py | 201 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++----------------\n shield-kitty-icon.py  | 162 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++\n shield-kitty-watch.py |  50 +++++++++++--\n shield_kitty_art.py   |  36 +++++++++\n 4 files changed, 379 insertions(+), 70 deletions(-)\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"cd ~/Projects/shield-kitty\necho \"=== does c9f7bc9 exist, and is it mine? ===\"\ngit log --oneline | head -8\necho \"--- c9f7bc9 detail ---\"\ngit show --stat --format=''%H%n%an <%ae>%n%ad%n%s'' c9f7bc9 2>&1 | head -20","time":{"start":1790451307295,"end":1790451307360}}}');
