led\n\n  × fail2ban.service - Fail2Ban Service\n       Loaded: loaded (/usr/lib/systemd/system/fail2ban.service; enabled; preset: disabled)\n       Active: failed (Result: exit-code) since Sat 2026-09-26 12:36:53 MST; 23s ago\n     Duration: 110ms\n   Invocation: 75093785771f42169f522a9fcf925ada\n         Docs: man:fail2ban(1)\n      Process: 199764 ExecStart=/usr/bin/fail2ban-server -xf start (code=exited, status=255/EXCEPTION)\n     Main PID: 199764 (code=exited, status=255/EXCEPTION)\n     Mem peak: 15.4M\n          CPU: 84ms\n  \n  Sep 26 12:36:53 living-asustufdashf15fx517zcfx517zc systemd[1]: Started Fail2Ban Service.\n  Sep 26 12:36:53 living-asustufdashf15fx517zcfx517zc fail2ban-server[199764]: 2026-09-26 12:36:53,322 fail2ban                [199764]: ERROR   Failed during configuration: Have not found any log file for ''recidive'' jail.\n  Sep 26 12:36:53 living-asustufdashf15fx517zcfx517zc fail2ban-server[199764]: 2026-09-26 12:36:53,327 fail2ban                [199764]: ERROR   Async configuration of server failed\n  Sep 26 12:36:53 living-asustufdashf15fx517zcfx517zc systemd[1]: fail2ban.service: Main process exited, code=exited, status=255/EXCEPTION\n  Sep 26 12:36:53 living-asustufdashf15fx517zcfx517zc systemd[1]: fail2ban.service: Failed with result ''exit-code''.\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"echo \"═══ IS IT ACTUALLY RUNNING? ═══\"\nsystemctl is-enabled fail2ban 2>/dev/null | sed ''s/^/  enabled: /''\nsystemctl is-active fail2ban 2>/dev/null | sed ''s/^/  active:  /''\necho\nsystemctl status fail2ban --no-pager 2>&1 | head -20 | sed ''s/^/  /''","time":{"start":1790451437239,"end":1790451437277}}}');
