h result ''exit-code''.\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"echo \"═══ WHY DID IT FAIL TO START? ═══\"\njournalctl -u fail2ban -S \"-10min\" --no-pager 2>&1 | tail -30 | sed ''s/^/  /''","time":{"start":1790451437581,"end":1790451437600}}}');
