to Blood but repo ships no icons/ dir -> all desktop icons would vanish; created ~/.local/share/icons/Blood inheriting BeautyLine,hicolor\n  \n  ## 2026-09-26 11:51:45 · ok\n  \n\n  --- hostname / user references ---\n  matches: 1\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"cd ~/Projects/buildlog\necho \"═══ DOES buildlog CONTAIN PERSONAL/SENSITIVE DATA? ═══\"\nhead -20 logs/buildlog.md | sed ''s/^/  /''\necho\necho \"  --- hostname / user references ---\"\ngrep -ciE \"living-asustuf|livings|192\\.168\\.|10\\.[0-9]+\\.|@|token|password\" logs/buildlog.md 2>/dev/null | sed ''s/^/  matches: /''","time":{"start":1790451792988,"end":1790451793005}}}');
