           PAM faillock: deny=10, unlock_time=30\n  firewalld-workstation.conf   deny inbound except SSH\n  shield-kitty-fail2ban.local  permanent IP bans (sddm/sudo/sshd/recidive)\n\nscripts/shield-kitty/\n  watch + alert                journal-tailing intrusion detector with\n                               notify-send alerts and fullscreen pixel kitty\n  device-blacklist/            udev device quarantine and permanent ban\n  forensics/evidence.py        HMAC-chained tamper-evident evidence store\n\nVerified before commit: no credentials in any staged file or history.\" 2>&1 | sed ''s/^/  /''\ngit push -q origin HEAD 2>&1 | sed ''s/^/  /'' && echo \"  [✓] pushed to hermes-security-scripts\" || echo \"  [✗] push failed\"\necho\ngit log --oneline -1 | sed ''s/^/  /''","time":{"start":1790451819538,"end":1790451821564}}}');
