hf15fx517zcfx517zc systemd[1]: fail2ban.service: Main process exited, code=exited, status=255/EXCEPTION\n\n  -> the test at 12:40 validated the FILE. It does not start the service.\n     ''failed'' is still the 12:36 result, unchanged.\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"echo \"═══ ANY RESTART SINCE 12:36? ═══\"\njournalctl -u fail2ban -S \"-30min\" --no-pager 2>&1 | grep -E \"Started|ERROR|status=\" | tail -8 | sed ''s/^/  /''\necho\necho \"  -> the test at 12:40 validated the FILE. It does not start the service.\"\necho \"     ''failed'' is still the 12:36 result, unchanged.\"","time":{"start":1790451965335,"end":1790451965350}}}');
