urrently PASS.\n    -> must STAY unblocked, or IPv6 breaks and large HTTPS downloads hang.\n\n  firewalld public zone permits: dhcpv6-client, ssh\n    -> ssh is a hole for a daemon that is DISABLED and NOT LISTENING.\n    -> only real inbound candidate is kdeconnectd 1716 + mDNS 5353, both blocked.\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"echo \"═══ STATE SUMMARY ═══\"\necho\necho \"  tor 0.4.9.13-1 IS installed, active, enabled.\"\necho \"    -> installed between my last two turns. SOCKS is 127.0.0.1:9050 (loopback only).\"\necho \"    -> loopback = NOT an inbound surface. Nothing to revoke there.\"\necho \"    -> browser still absent, so nothing is using it yet.\"\necho\necho \"  ICMP: nothing blocked. PMTU + IPv6 NDP currently PASS.\"\necho \"    -> must STAY unblocked, or IPv6 breaks and large HTTPS downloads hang.\"\necho\necho \"  firewalld public zone permits: dhcpv6-client, ssh\"\necho \"    -> ssh is a hole for a daemon that is DISABLED and NOT LISTENING.\"\necho \"    -> only real inbound candidate is kdeconnectd 1716 + mDNS 5353, both blocked.\"","time":{"start":1790452643643,"end":1790452643672}}}');
