wk -F''#'' ''{split($1,a,\"/\"); n=$1; sub(/.*\\//,\"\",n); print n\"|\"$1\"|\"$2}'' | sed -E ''s/\\.git$//'' ) 2>/dev/null | head -8\necho \"---\"\necho \"present dirs: $(ls -d */ 2>/dev/null | wc -l)\"","time":{"start":1790452814956,"end":1790452814991}}}');
INSERT INTO part VALUES('prt_0df4dd3370018Y9qy4njph7PdY','msg_0df4db906001JueJFQ26elTyo1','ses_f211dfcd4ffevS1Yoddwab036g',1790452814647,1790452815674,'{"type":"text","text":"Important — the header comment now lies, and I need to verify whether that file *replaces* or *merges* with firewalld''s built-in zone, because `dhcpv6-client` isn''t in it:","time":{"start":1790452814647,"end":1790452815673}}');
INSERT INTO part VALUES('prt_0df4dd47e001ayK4UEx0n6RI3E','msg_0df4db906001JueJFQ26elTyo1','ses_f211dfcd4ffevS1Yoddwab036g',1790452814974,1790452815701,'{"type":"tool","tool":"bash","callID":"call_function_e0edxfy9tftd_1","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"echo \"═══ LIVE /etc/firewalld/zones/public.xml ═══\"\ncat /etc/firewalld/zones/public.xml 2>/dev/null | grep -vE \"^\\s*$\" | sed ''s/^/  /'' || echo \"  (absent)\"\necho\necho \"═══ does our source differ from what is live? ═══\"\ndiff -q ~/Projects/zen-hardening/firewalld-workstation.conf /etc/firewalld/zones/public.xml >/dev/null 2>&1 \\\n  && echo \"  identical\" || echo \"  DIFFERENT — live file is not a copy of the source\""},"output":"═══ LIVE /etc/firewalld/zones/public.xml ═══\n  <?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"utf-8\"?>\n  <!--\n    Workstation firewall — Garuda Linux / Arch\n    Install:  sudo cp firewalld-workstation.conf /etc/firewalld/zones/public.xml\n              sudo firewall-cmd --reload\n    Revert:   sudo rm /etc/firewalld/zones/public.xml && sudo firewall-cmd --reload\n    Zone: public (Garuda''s default active zone)\n    Opens: SSH only.\n    Steam needs more and is NOT configured here. Add explicitly when ready:\n      sudo firewall-cmd --add-port=27015-27016/udp --permanent   # matchmaking\n      sudo firewall-cmd --add-port=27017-27019/tcp --permanent   # in-home streaming\n  -->\n  <zone>\n    <short>Public</short>\n    <description>Workstation profile: deny incoming except SSH.</description>\n    <service name=\"ssh\"/>\n    <!-- No mdns or SMB chatter on untrusted networks -->\n    <service name=\"mdns\" disable=\"yes\"/>\n    <service name=\"samba-client\" enable=\"no\"/>\n    <!-- ICMP: keep ping for diagnostics -->\n    <protocol value=\"icmp\"/>\n    <protocol value=\"ipv6-icmp\"/>\n    <masquerade/>\n  </zone>\n\n═══ does our source differ from what is live? ═══\n  DIFFERENT — live file is not a copy of the source\n","metadata":{"output":"═══ LIVE /etc/firewalld/zones/public.xml ═══\n  <?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"utf-8\"?>\n  <!--\n    Workstation firewall — Garuda Linux / Arch\n    Install:  sudo cp firewalld-workstation.conf /etc/firewalld/zones/public.xml\n              sudo firewall-cmd --reload\n    Revert:   sudo rm /etc/firewalld/zones/public.xml && sudo firewall-cmd --reload\n    Zone: public (Garuda''s default active zone)\n    Opens: SSH only.\n    Steam needs more and is NOT configured here. Add explicitly when ready:\n      sudo firewall-cmd --add-port=27015-27016/udp --permanent   # matchmaking\n      sudo firewall-cmd --add-port=27017-27019/tcp --permanent   # in-home streaming\n  -->\n  <zone>\n    <short>Public</short>\n    <description>Workstation profile: deny incoming except SSH.</description>\n    <service name=\"ssh\"/>\n    <!-- No mdns or SMB chatter on untrusted networks -->\n    <service name=\"mdns\" disable=\"yes\"/>\n    <service name=\"samba-client\" enable=\"no\"/>\n    <!-- ICMP: keep ping for diagnostics -->\n    <protocol value=\"icmp\"/>\n    <protocol value=\"ipv6-icmp\"/>\n    <masquerade/>\n  </zone>\n\n═══ does our source differ from what is live? ═══\n  DIFFERENT — live file is not a copy of the source\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"echo \"═══ LIVE /etc/firewalld/zones/public.xml ═══\"\ncat /etc/firewalld/zones/public.xml 2>/dev/null | grep -vE \"^\\s*$\" | sed ''s/^/  /'' || echo \"  (absent)\"\necho\necho \"═══ does our source differ from what is live? ═══\"\ndiff -q ~/Projects/zen-hardening/firewalld-workstation.conf /etc/firewalld/zones/public.xml >/dev/null 2>&1 \\\n  && echo \"  identical\" || echo \"  DIFFERENT — live file is not a copy of the source\"","time":{"start":1790452815672,"end":1790452815700}}}');
