\"pending\",\n    \"priority\": \"low\"\n  }\n]","metadata":{"todos":[{"content":"Re-clone electron34 PKGBUILD and re-create 1.3GB shallow chromium mirror","status":"in_progress","priority":"high"},{"content":"Shallow-seed all ~164 chromium-mirror_* DEPS repos at pinned commits","status":"pending","priority":"high"},{"content":"Reapply Blood Build theme to Hermes + OpenCode, skipping kdeglobals Great Vibes lines","status":"pending","priority":"high"},{"content":"Journal progress in buildlog (now working after identity fix)","status":"pending","priority":"medium"},{"content":"After user installs gh: create GitHub remotes for zen-hardening, nyan-gfsf-alert, buildlog, shield-kitty and push","status":"pending","priority":"medium"},{"content":"Build electron34 then paru -S void-bin","status":"pending","priority":"low"}],"truncated":false},"title":"6 todos","time":{"start":1790452920428,"end":1790452920430}}}');
