ins installed for terminal/editor use where it is legible.\n\nKDE globals were also restored to Fira Sans, which the rest of kdeglobals\nalready used (menuFont, toolBarFont, smallestReadableFont).\"\ngit log --oneline | head -3","time":{"start":1790452973539,"end":1790452973559}}}');
