wasteful, since building a pinned tree never needs the history.\n\nA pre-seeded bare repo makes download_git() take its fetch branch instead,\nwhich is cheap and whose failure is only a warning.\" && git log --oneline | head -2","time":{"start":1790452998205,"end":1790452998231}}}');
