 26 12:57:20 zero polkit-kde-authentication-agent-1[1431]: polkit_qt_listener_initiate_authentication_finish callback for  0x5619a3a2c290\n  Sep 26 12:57:20 zero polkit-kde-authentication-agent-1[1431]: Finish obtain authorization: true\n  Sep 26 12:57:20 zero polkit-kde-authentication-agent-1[1431]: Dialog cancelled\n  Sep 26 12:57:20 zero polkit-kde-authentication-agent-1[1431]: Finishing obtaining privileges\n  Sep 26 12:57:20 zero polkit-kde-authentication-agent-1[1431]: Finish obtain authorization: true\n  Sep 26 12:57:20 zero firewalld[186159]: ERROR: INVALID_ICMPTYPE: v6-redirect\n  Sep 26 12:57:20 zero systemd[1]: polkit-agent-helper@18-40961-1431_193-1000.service: Deactivated successfully.\n  Sep 26 12:57:20 zero systemd[1]: Finished Authorization Manager Agent Helper (PID 1431/UID 1000).\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"echo \"═══ 4. What ran at 12:57 across ALL units? ═══\"\njournalctl --since \"12:56:50\" --until \"12:57:30\" --no-pager 2>&1 | grep -viE \"kernel|systemd-logind\" | tail -30 | sed ''s/^/  /''","time":{"start":1790453361983,"end":1790453362004}}}');
