 0) ═══\"\ngrep -c $''\\r'' apply-firewall.sh 2>/dev/null | sed ''s/^/  lines with CR: /''\necho\necho \"═══ SHEBANG BYTES ═══\"\nhead -1 apply-firewall.sh | od -c | head -2 | sed ''s/^/  /''","time":{"start":1790453749372,"end":1790453749420}}}');
