INSERT INTO part VALUES('prt_0df5d0a21001VQVSTKbOUmMhxc','msg_0df5d015c001FQ7Fdy74bAF2hz','ses_f211dfcd4ffevS1Yoddwab036g',1790453811746,1790453816242,'{"type":"text","text":"Confirmed independently — not just taking the script''s word:\n\n```\nfirewalld state : running\ndefault zone    : workstation\nwlo1 zone       : workstation\n```\n\nAnd the allowlist is genuinely empty:\n\n```\nservices     : dhcpv6-client\nports        : (none)\nrich rules   : (none)\nicmp-blocks  : (none)      -> PMTU + IPv6 NDP pass\nforward      : no\nmasquerade   : no\n```\n\nThat is the strictest useful state: `kdeconnectd`, mDNS, samba, and ssh are all unreachable inbound. `ssh` is gone — the hole that started this. You also lost the `masquerade` I''d wrongly included, which was doing nothing useful on a client anyway.\n\n**One thing left to confirm.** I could not read `nft` unprivileged, so I can''t see the actual ruleset. Please run:\n\n```bash\nsudo nft list tables | grep firewalld\n```\n\nIf that prints table names, enforcement is real. If it''s empty, the script''s PASS was wrong and I need to know.\n\n## On the two files that aren''t mine\n\nBefore you run anything else from that directory — `unban-self.sh` (13:04) and `fail2ban-coverage.md` (13:05) were written by Hermes, not me. You said Hermes works in parallel, so that''s expected, but a script that unbans IPs touches the same firewall machinery we just spent an hour fixing. I''d rather read it than assume.\n\nWant me to check those two?\n\n## Remaining queue\n\n1. **fail2ban jail list** — never verified. `sddm`, `sudo`, `sshd`, `recidive`. And the `PartOf=firewalld` bug means fail2ban gets bounced on every firewalld restart; worth a permanent fix via `systemctl edit`.\n2. **`wlo1` MAC randomization** — `set-anon-identity.sh` ran and set the hostname, but I never confirmed `mac-address-mode` actually took.\n3. **Push the corrected configs** — `workstation.xml`, `apply-firewall.sh`, and the `PartOf` workaround. Still unpushed.\n4. **No browser installed** — tor''s SOCKS port is running with nothing using it.","time":{"start":1790453811746,"end":1790453816241}}');
