INSERT INTO part VALUES('prt_0df5f7bb2001DZTELBsRij7MWQ','msg_0df5f7295001CFqqtL6I8RlLfP','ses_f211dfcd4ffevS1Yoddwab036g',1790453971890,1790453976394,'{"type":"text","text":"All three checks pass: `sddm`/`sudo` gone, no `-1` remaining, only `sshd` and `recidive`. Installing and testing:\n\n```bash\nsudo cp /home/livings/Projects/zen-hardening/shield-kitty-fail2ban.local /etc/fail2ban/jail.d/shield-kitty.conf\nsudo rm -f /etc/fail2ban/jail.d/shield-kitty-fail2ban.local\nsudo fail2ban-client -t\n```\n\nThat last one must print `configuration test is successful`. If it doesn''t, **stop** — don''t restart.\n\nThen apply, working around the `PartOf=` bug we already hit:\n\n```bash\nsudo systemctl stop fail2ban\nsudo systemctl restart fail2ban\nsudo fail2ban-client status\n```\n\nExpect a jail list of **`sshd` only** — `recidive` stays disabled until its second-start step, and `sddm`/`sudo` are now gone by design.\n\nThen enable recidive:\n\n```bash\nsudo sed -i ''s/^enabled  = false/enabled  = true/'' /etc/fail2ban/jail.d/shield-kitty.conf\nsudo systemctl stop fail2ban\nsudo systemctl restart fail2ban\nsudo fail2ban-client status\n```\n\nNow expect **`recidive`, `sshd`**.\n\n## What this changes\n\n| | Before | After |\n|---|---|---|\n| `sddm` | enabled, could never ban | **removed** — structurally impossible |\n| `sudo` | enabled, could never ban | **removed** — structurally impossible |\n| `sshd` | `bantime = -1` | `bantime = 86400` |\n| `recidive` | `bantime = -1` | `bantime = 86400` |\n| Self-lockout risk | permanent, every port | clears after 24h |\n\nI documented the dead jails in the config header so nobody re-adds them thinking they''re protection. Your real coverage now: `pam_faillock deny=10` for local password guessing, and the strict `workstation` zone for everything remote.\n\nOne honest note — with `ssh` firewalled off and `sshd` inactive, **both remaining jails match nothing today.** They''re insurance for a future `sshd` enable, not active protection. The only thing genuinely defending this machine right now is the firewall and faillock.\n\nWant me to push this once you''ve confirmed the test passes?","time":{"start":1790453971890,"end":1790453976393}}');
