INSERT INTO part VALUES('prt_0df69f0860018HgL2E33OopLGc','msg_0df69e8c0001NgmIbgUzc7ac3V','ses_f211dfcd4ffevS1Yoddwab036g',1790454657159,1790454657161,'{"type":"step-start"}');
INSERT INTO part VALUES('prt_0df69f08b001oN1LbfGKROBYc2','msg_0df69e8c0001NgmIbgUzc7ac3V','ses_f211dfcd4ffevS1Yoddwab036g',1790454657163,1790454660963,'{"type":"text","text":"Tor is healthy — `Bootstrapped 100% (done)`, circuit established, SOCKS on loopback only.\n\n## Where \"build it out\" stands\n\n**Done and verified:**\n- Firewall: `workstation` zone, all inbound denied except `dhcpv6-client`, nft rules loaded\n- fail2ban: 2 jails, 24h bans, zone pinned, 0 errors\n- Hostname: `zero` across `/etc/hostname`, `/etc/hosts`, runtime\n- Tor: bootstrapped 100%, SOCKS loopback-only\n- Pushed to `hermes-security-scripts` @ `4346767`\n\n**Needs you (root):**\n```bash\nsudo bash /home/livings/Projects/zen-hardening/set-anon-identity.sh\n```\nMAC randomization never actually applied — wrong property name for NetworkManager 1.58. Fixed with auto-detection, and it now fails loudly instead of printing `[ok]` and doing nothing.\n\n**The remaining gap is the browser.** Tor is running with nothing using it. Two paths:\n\n1. **`torbrowser-launcher`** — the correct tool. Disposable identity per session, no persistent fingerprint. This is what actually gives you anonymous browsing.\n2. **Point an existing browser at `127.0.0.1:9050`** — meaningfully weaker. Your profile, cookies, canvas/WebGL fingerprint and timezone persist across sessions, which links them. The Tor Project treats this as a known weakness, not best practice.\n\nI''d install `torbrowser-launcher`. Nothing else is installed, so there''s no browser to integrate with:\n\n```bash\nsudo pacman -S torbrowser-launcher\n```\n\nWant me to also write a single `bootstrap.sh` that reapplies this entire verified stack on a fresh install? Given you rebuild from scratch, that''s the piece that makes the work survive — right now all of it lives in git but nothing applies it automatically.","time":{"start":1790454657163,"end":1790454660961}}');
