INSERT INTO part VALUES('prt_0df7b71d0001XlRRj3TYJu1F0O','msg_0df7b6b8d001Emc0rNGj0hyQit','ses_f20e5cfc2ffeSFa4odnoYLiUOk',1790455804368,1790455804389,'{"type":"tool","tool":"bash","callID":"call_function_cvruh59z5ujj_1","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd ~/Projects/zen-hardening\nsed -n ''76,96p'' fail2ban-coverage.md"},"output":"have not locked yourself out.\n\nEscape hatch:\n\n```bash\nsudo ~/Projects/zen-hardening/unban-self.sh --list    # is my address banned?\nsudo ~/Projects/zen-hardening/unban-self.sh          # clear bans on my addresses\n```\n\n## Verification commands used\n\n```bash\nsystemctl is-active sshd                       # inactive\nss -ltn | grep -c '':22 ''                        # 0\nfail2ban-regex /tmp/remote.log /etc/fail2ban/filter.d/pam-generic.conf   # 1 matched\nfail2ban-regex /tmp/local.log  /etc/fail2ban/filter.d/pam-generic.conf   # 0 matched\nfail2ban-client -t                              # configuration test is successful\n```\n\n`fail2ban-client status` needs root (socket is 0700), so jail state cannot be\nread unprivileged.\n","metadata":{"output":"have not locked yourself out.\n\nEscape hatch:\n\n```bash\nsudo ~/Projects/zen-hardening/unban-self.sh --list    # is my address banned?\nsudo ~/Projects/zen-hardening/unban-self.sh          # clear bans on my addresses\n```\n\n## Verification commands used\n\n```bash\nsystemctl is-active sshd                       # inactive\nss -ltn | grep -c '':22 ''                        # 0\nfail2ban-regex /tmp/remote.log /etc/fail2ban/filter.d/pam-generic.conf   # 1 matched\nfail2ban-regex /tmp/local.log  /etc/fail2ban/filter.d/pam-generic.conf   # 0 matched\nfail2ban-client -t                              # configuration test is successful\n```\n\n`fail2ban-client status` needs root (socket is 0700), so jail state cannot be\nread unprivileged.\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"cd ~/Projects/zen-hardening\nsed -n ''76,96p'' fail2ban-coverage.md","time":{"start":1790455804376,"end":1790455804389}}}');
