 THREE REAL GAPS found auditing ''ban remote access for 1 day'': (1) ignoreip includes 10.0.0.0/8 and this machine IS 10.197.250.246/8, so 16,777,216 addresses on the local network are permanently EXEMPT from banning -- fail2ban cannot ban ''another system'' on this network at all. (2) sshd jail is INERT: sshd inactive, nothing listens on 22. (3) kdeconnectd is LAN-exposed on *:1716 tcp+udp with NO jail -- the only real remote surface, unmonitored\n\nOn branch master\nnothing to commit, working tree clean\n21de717 note: THREE REAL GAPS found auditing ''ban remote access for 1 day'': (1) ignoreip includes 10.0.0.0/8 and this machine IS 10.197.250.246/8, so 16,777,216 addresses on the local network are permanently EXEMPT from banning -- fail2ban cannot ban ''another system'' on this network at all. (2) sshd jail is INERT: sshd inactive, nothing listens on 22. (3) kdeconnectd is LAN-exposed on *:1716 tcp+udp with NO jail -- the only real remote surface, unmonitored\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"cd ~/Projects/buildlog\nbuildlog note \"THREE REAL GAPS found auditing ''ban remote access for 1 day'': (1) ignoreip includes 10.0.0.0/8 and this machine IS 10.197.250.246/8, so 16,777,216 addresses on the local network are permanently EXEMPT from banning -- fail2ban cannot ban ''another system'' on this network at all. (2) sshd jail is INERT: sshd inactive, nothing listens on 22. (3) kdeconnectd is LAN-exposed on *:1716 tcp+udp with NO jail -- the only real remote surface, unmonitored\" 2>&1 | tail -1\necho; git add -A 2>/dev/null; git commit -q -m \"log: fail2ban 1-day ban already live; ignoreip/sshd/kdeconnect gaps; spoofing uncovered\" 2>/dev/null; git log --oneline | head -1","time":{"start":1790455818191,"end":1790455818217}}}');
