08), confirmed deliberate by user, not drift. Repo and live now byte-identical on all functional lines. Preconditions verified before endorsing it: /var/log/fail2ban.log present (root:root 0600, 34K), loglevel=INFO in fail2ban.conf (below WARNING recidive silently never counts bans), backend=polling+logpath since the journal lacks fail2ban''s own log. fail2ban-client -t passes with recidive on\" 2>&1 | tail -1","time":{"start":1790456019613,"end":1790456019636}}}');
