e IUse% Mounted on\n    /dev/mapper/luks-8c39203b-6764-4e5c-b1a9-6dedb64c05c1      0     0     0     - /\n    /dev/mapper/luks-8c39203b-6764-4e5c-b1a9-6dedb64c05c1      0     0     0     - /home\n\n  --- memory ---\n                   total        used        free      shared  buff/cache   available\n    Mem:           7.4Gi       5.5Gi       825Mi        92Mi       1.6Gi       1.9Gi\n    Swap:          7.4Gi       2.9Gi       4.4Gi\n\n  --- swap active? ---\n    NAME       TYPE      SIZE USED PRIO\n    /dev/zram0 partition 7.4G 2.9G  100\n","metadata":{"output":"═══ STORAGE HEALTH ═══\n  --- btrfs scrub / usage ---\n        Device size:\t\t 476.64GiB\n        Used:\t\t\t  16.88GiB\n        Free (estimated):\t\t 456.65GiB\t(min: 230.84GiB)\n        Free (statfs, df):\t\t 456.64GiB\n    Data,single: Size:21.01GiB, Used:15.98GiB (76.07%)\n    Metadata,DUP: Size:2.00GiB, Used:462.69MiB (22.59%)\n    System,DUP: Size:8.00MiB, Used:16.00KiB (0.20%)\n\n  --- space ---\n    Filesystem     Type      Size  Used Avail Use% Mounted on\n    /dev/dm-0      btrfs     477G   17G  457G   4% /\n    efivarfs       efivarfs  192K  131K   57K  70% /sys/firmware/efi/efivars\n    /dev/dm-0      btrfs     477G   17G  457G   4% /srv\n    /dev/dm-0      btrfs     477G   17G  457G   4% /home\n    /dev/dm-0      btrfs     477G   17G  457G   4% /root\n    /dev/dm-0      btrfs     477G   17G  457G   4% /var/tmp\n    /dev/dm-0      btrfs     477G   17G  457G   4% /var/cache\n    /dev/dm-0      btrfs     477G   17G  457G   4% /var/log\n    /dev/nvme0n1p1 vfat      300M  1.2M  299M   1% /boot/efi\n\n  --- inodes (full = silent failure) ---\n    Filesystem                                            Inodes IUsed IFree IUse% Mounted on\n    /dev/mapper/luks-8c39203b-6764-4e5c-b1a9-6dedb64c05c1      0     0     0     - /\n    /dev/mapper/luks-8c39203b-6764-4e5c-b1a9-6dedb64c05c1      0     0     0     - /home\n\n  --- memory ---\n                   total        used        free      shared  buff/cache   available\n    Mem:           7.4Gi       5.5Gi       825Mi        92Mi       1.6Gi       1.9Gi\n    Swap:          7.4Gi       2.9Gi       4.4Gi\n\n  --- swap active? ---\n    NAME       TYPE      SIZE USED PRIO\n    /dev/zram0 partition 7.4G 2.9G  100\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"echo \"═══ STORAGE HEALTH ═══\"\necho \"  --- btrfs scrub / usage ---\"\nbtrfs filesystem usage / 2>/dev/null | grep -E ''Device size|Used|Free'' | sed ''s/^/    /'' || echo \"    (needs root)\"\necho\necho \"  --- space ---\"\ndf -hT -x tmpfs -x devtmpfs 2>/dev/null | sed ''s/^/    /''\necho\necho \"  --- inodes (full = silent failure) ---\"\ndf -i / /home 2>/dev/null | sed ''s/^/    /''\necho\necho \"  --- memory ---\"\nfree -h 2>/dev/null | sed ''s/^/    /''\necho\necho \"  --- swap active? ---\"\nswapon --show 2>/dev/null | sed ''s/^/    /'' || echo \"    (none)\"","time":{"start":1790456127830,"end":1790456127857}}}');
