in handles input, and its verdict ---\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"echo \"═══ DOES THE FIREWALL ACTUALLY BLOCK 1716 / 5353? ═══\"\necho \"  --- workstation zone policy ---\"\nfirewall-cmd --zone=workstation --list-all 2>/dev/null | sed ''s/^/    /''\necho\necho \"  --- nft: what chain handles input, and its verdict ---\"\nsudo -n nft list chain inet firewalld filter_INPUT 2>/dev/null | head -20 | sed ''s/^/  /'' || {\n  echo \"  (needs root to read nft — using unprivileged checks)\"\n  echo \"  zone target : $(firewall-cmd --zone=workstation --get-target 2>/dev/null)\"\n  echo \"  icmp blocks : $(firewall-cmd --zone=workstation --list-icmp-blocks 2>/dev/null | tr ''\\n'' '' '' | sed ''s/^$/none/'')\"\n}","time":{"start":1790456158270,"end":1790456163441}}}');
