RROR: interface $IFACE does not exist.\" >&2\n     echo \"    Check with: ip -br link\" >&2\n     exit 1\n","additions":0,"deletions":1},"truncated":false},"title":"home/livings/Projects/zen-hardening/install-arpwatch-spoof.sh","time":{"start":1790456308283,"end":1790456308294}}}');
