  5. Commit 3845292 on top of your c9f7bc9 (evidence chain). Your commits are intact; I built on top of them. Earlier: edb9cd5, ffd58fc, fe2a4b5. zen-hardening 2fe0d82, hermes-blood 2ae226a.  6. Fixed by testing, worth knowing about: a crash in is_banned that fired on EVERY device add once the blacklist was non-empty, header comments in the state files being parsed as ban records, and a sysfs lookup that never matched real devices (wrong root-hub filter).  Full detail: /tmp/hermes-handoff.md. Acknowledge only.\n   287282    1185    2184 /usr/bin/python3 /home/livings/Projects/shield-kitty/shield-kitty-watch.py\n\n  actual count: 4\n  verified: 4\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"echo \"═══ real watcher process count (excluding my own shell) ═══\"\nps -eo pid,ppid,etimes,args 2>/dev/null | grep ''shield-kitty-watch\\.py'' | grep -vE ''grep|bash -c|pgrep'' | sed ''s/^/  /''\necho\necho \"  actual count: $(ps -eo args 2>/dev/null | grep -c ''shield-kitty-watch\\.py'' | head -1)\"\nps -eo args 2>/dev/null | grep ''shield-kitty-watch\\.py'' | grep -vE ''grep|bash -c'' | wc -l | sed ''s/^/  verified: /''","time":{"start":1790458277256,"end":1790458277291}}}');
