en 621 top level 5 path @\n    ID 257 gen 622 top level 5 path @home\n    ^ top level 256 = the @ (root) subvolume, NOT @home.\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"echo \"═══ GITHUB TOKEN — current state ═══\"\necho \"  local file: $([ -f ~/.config/gh/token.clean ] && echo ''STILL PRESENT'' || echo ''shredded (gone)'')\"\necho \"  gh CLI:     $(command -v gh >/dev/null 2>&1 && echo present || echo ''not installed'')\"\necho \"  any other credential store:\"\nfor f in ~/.git-credentials ~/.netrc ~/.config/gh/hosts.yml; do\n  [ -f \"$f\" ] && echo \"    [!!] $f exists\" || echo \"    [ok] $f absent\"\ndone\necho\necho \"  btrfs snapshots (could a snapshot hold the plaintext token?):\"\nsudo -n /usr/local/sbin/audit-btrfs 2>&1 | sed -n ''/subvolumes/,/scrub/p'' | grep -c ''snapshots'' | sed ''s/^/    snapshot count: /''\nsudo -n /usr/local/sbin/audit-btrfs 2>&1 | grep ''top level'' | head -2 | sed ''s/^/    /''\necho \"    ^ top level 256 = the @ (root) subvolume, NOT @home.\"","time":{"start":1790459131944,"end":1790459132000}}}');
