[3/6] preparing state\"\n # 0755 so the unprivileged scanner (User=livings) can traverse into the\n","additions":1,"deletions":1},"truncated":false},"title":"home/livings/Projects/zen-hardening/install-arpwatch-spoof.sh","time":{"start":1790459268604,"end":1790459268615}}}');
