 stop_mac)\"\n  258:      log \"FLIP-FLOP on infrastructure addr $start_ip ($start_mac -> $stop_mac) -- not alerting\"\n  261:    log \"FLIP-FLOP $start_ip $start_mac -> $stop_mac\"\n  262:    notify \"critical\" \"ARP spoof: $start_ip claimed two MACs\" \\\n  268:  log \"new host $start_ip $start_mac\"\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"cd ~/Projects/zen-hardening\ngrep -nE \"shield-kitty-alert|ALERT=|python3|notify|log \\\"\" arpwatch-spoof-alert.sh | tail -12 | sed ''s/^/  /''","time":{"start":1790459297692,"end":1790459297705}}}');
