ll-audit-readonly.sh\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"cd /home/livings/Projects/zen-hardening\necho \"═══ is DEST still referenced? ═══\"\ngrep -n ''DEST'' install-shield-kitty-units.sh | sed ''s/^/  /'' || echo \"  no references remain (safe to have removed it)\"\necho\necho \"═══ syntax check all three ═══\"\nfor f in install-arpwatch-spoof.sh install-shield-kitty-units.sh install-audit-readonly.sh; do\n  bash -n \"$f\" 2>&1 | sed \"s/^/  /\" && printf \"  [ok]   %s\\n\" \"$f\" || printf \"  [FAIL] %s\\n\" \"$f\"\ndone","time":{"start":1790459467515,"end":1790459467536}}}');
