                      \n      ├─nvme0n1p1                                     300M vfat                  c12a7328-f81f-11d2-ba4b-00a0c93ec93b /boot/efi\n      └─nvme0n1p2                                   476.6G crypto_LUKS root      0fc63daf-8483-4772-8e79-3d69d8477de4 \n        └─luks-8c39203b-6764-4e5c-b1a9-6dedb64c05c1 476.6G btrfs                                                      /var/log\n","metadata":{"output":"═══ BOOTLOADER — what actually boots this machine? ═══\n  ESP mount: /dev/nvme0n1p1\n  ESP contents:\n\n  recursive tree (dirs only):\n      /boot/efi\n\n  firmware mode: UEFI\n  secure boot:   disabled (unknown)\n\n  grub present on disk?\n      /usr/bin/grub-install\n      /usr/bin/grub-mkconfig\n      fonts\n      grub-btrfs.cfg\n      grub.cfg\n      grubenv\n      locale\n      themes\n      x86_64-efi\n\n  disk partition table:\n      NAME                                            SIZE FSTYPE      PARTLABEL PARTTYPE                             MOUNTPOINT\n      zram0                                           7.4G swap                                                       [SWAP]\n      nvme0n1                                       476.9G                                                            \n      ├─nvme0n1p1                                     300M vfat                  c12a7328-f81f-11d2-ba4b-00a0c93ec93b /boot/efi\n      └─nvme0n1p2                                   476.6G crypto_LUKS root      0fc63daf-8483-4772-8e79-3d69d8477de4 \n        └─luks-8c39203b-6764-4e5c-b1a9-6dedb64c05c1 476.6G btrfs                                                      /var/log\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"echo \"═══ BOOTLOADER — what actually boots this machine? ═══\"\necho \"  ESP mount: $(findmnt -no SOURCE /boot/efi)\"\necho \"  ESP contents:\"\nls -la /boot/efi/ 2>/dev/null | sed ''s/^/      /''\necho\necho \"  recursive tree (dirs only):\"\nfind /boot/efi -maxdepth 3 -type d 2>/dev/null | sed ''s/^/      /''\necho\necho \"  firmware mode: