ase for their machines. I''ll note hostname \"zero\". Maybe \"Rani\" appears in konsole/Garuda.profile? Or in `~/.hermes/channel_directory.json`? Let me check that plus auth.json platform names.\n\nNext steps batch:\n1. Check DB date ranges and session counts.\n2. Find all lia memory/vault files.\n3. Check for corrupted lia versions (git fsck output was empty for first, then ===INV=== empty too — actually first fsck output showed nothing before ===INV===; both fine).\n4. Check gh CLI status and ssh -T github.","time":{"start":1790625079128,"end":1790625090267}}');
